clock 10 8
floor tile 60 28  flat 14.5   # the steel finish clock's tile (on top of the rail block it replaces)
clock 60 28
floor tile 38 36  flat 15.5   # the glass finish clock's tile (on top of the rail block it replaces)
clock 38 36

